<title>USA: Eurogas methane pact with Texaco proceeds.</title>
<headline>Eurogas methane pact with Texaco proceeds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurogas Inc said Thursday that Texaco Inc has finished reviewing legal documents and scientific studies for a proposal to access coal bed methane that Eurogas controls in Poland.</p>
<p>Eurogas said its methane gas concessions in South Central Poland include three joint ventures with the Polish government. The gas is trapped within the seams of coal beds.</p>
<p>Eurogas said it is in &quot;the final stages&quot; of negotations with Texaco to develop the concessions and begin producing gas.</p>
</text>
